1. [LNK File Structure Overview](#lnk-file-structure-overview)
2. [Binary Format Deep Dive](#binary-format-deep-dive)
3. [Attack Techniques (8 Major Categories)](#attack-techniques-8-major-categories)
4. [Real-World Campaign Examples](#real-world-campaign-examples)
5. [Detection Methodologies](#detection-methodologies)
6. [Risk Assessment](#risk-assessment)
7. [Recommendations](#recommendations)

