# Appendix: Technical References

## MS-SHLLINK Specification
- **Source:** Microsoft official documentation
- **URL:** https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/openspecs/windows_protocols/ms-shllink/
- **Sections:**
  - 2.1: Shell Link Header structure
  - 2.2: LinkTargetIDList
  - 2.3: LinkInfo structure
  - 2.5: LinkDataBlocks (all optional blocks)

## CVE-2025-9491 (Whitespace Padding)
- **Description:** Windows Shortcut Property Display Vulnerability
- **Impact:** Attackers hide commands beyond 260-char display
- **Status:** Microsoft classifies as UI bug, no patch

## Real-World Campaign References
- **UNC6384:** Mandiant research, March-August 2025
- **APT36:** Targeting Indian government, May-September 2025
- **Gamaredon:** Ongoing Ukrainian targeting, CVE-2025-9491 exploitation
- **KONNI:** AI-generated payloads, 2025-2026
- **Sidewinder:** LNK phishing, continuous
- **Kimsuky:** Remote icon fetch, 2025

## Tools for Analysis
- **LECmd** (Eric Zimmerman): LNK file parser
- **pylnk3/LnkParse3:** Python libraries
- **YARA-X:** Next-gen pattern matching with lnk module
- **lnkbomb:** LNK generation (attacker tool)
- **lnkup:** LNK modification (attacker tool)

